><li><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/featured-in-news/all/all/2026">Featured in news</a></li><li><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/events/2026">Upcoming &amp; Past Events</a></li><li><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/latest-happenings/all/all/2026">Latest Happenings</a></li><li><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/Video-Gallery">Video Gallery</a></li></ul></li></ul></li><li><a href="#">Global Engagement</a><ul class="menu"><li><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/about-us/global-engagement-office">About Us</a></li><li><a href="/international-degree-programme/">International Degree Pathways (IDP)</a></li><li><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/geo/transnational-education-partners-tne">Transnational Education Partners (TNE)</a></li><li><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/student-exchange-programme">Student Exchange Programme</a></li><li><a href="http://mobilityprogramme.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/" target="_blank">Student Mobility Programme</a></li></ul></li><li><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/centre-of-excellence-for-research%2C-value-innovation-and-entrepreneurship">Research</a></li></ul></nav></div></div></div></div></div><div id="main-content"><div class="panel-panel panel-col-content"><div class="inside"><div class="panel-display panel-twocol-30-70 clearfix" ><div class="panel-panel panel-col-top"><div class="inside"><header class="page-header"><div class="mask-pattern"></div><div class="mask"></div> <img class="page-header-bg page-header-bg-1" typeof="foaf:Image" src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/styles/hero_banner__1960x330_/public/field_image/2019/03/accommodation.jpg?itok=_p1wjAEK" width="1960" height="330" alt="accommodation" title="accommodation" /><div class="page-header-inner"><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="col-md-12"> <span class="page-title clearfix"> <span class="pull-left"></span> <i class="pull-left"></i> </span></div></div></div></div> </header><div class="panel-separator"></div><div class="kopa-breadcrumb"><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="col-md-12"><div class="pull-left"><h1>Accommodation</h1></div><div class="pull-right"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div> <section class="kopa-area kopa-area-31"><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="col-md-3 col-sm-3 col-xs-12 panel-col-thirty"> <nav class="sub-nav-mobile clearfix"><a class="pull"><span class="sub-menu-title"> Sub Menu <span class="fa fa-angle-down padleft-10"></span></span></a><ul class="sub-menu-mobile clearfix"><li><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/accommodation/Kuala-Lumpur?display=Kuala-Lumpur-Campus">Accommodation</a></li><li><a href="http://lib.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/">Library Services</a></li><li><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/training-and-internship">Training and Internship</a></li><li><a href="#">Student Experience</a><ul class="menu"><li><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/students-activities-and-recreation/Kuala-Lumpur?display=Kuala-Lumpur-Campus">Students Activities and Recreation</a></li><li><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/student-council-and-student-clubs/Kuala-Lumpur?display=Kuala-Lumpur-Campus">Student Council and Student Clubs</a></li><li><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/orientation-day">Orientation Day</a></li><li><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/youth-beyond-boundaries">Youth Beyond Boundaries</a></li></ul></li><li><a href="#">Student Support</a><ul class="menu"><li><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/student-development-and-counselling">Student Development & Counselling</a></li><li><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/student-disability-support">Student Disability Support</a></li><li><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/student-welfare">Student Welfare Council</a></li><li><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/supporting-services">Supporting Services</a></li></ul></li><li><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/ucsi-news/2025">Publicity & Events</a></li></ul></nav></div><div class="col-md-9 col-sm-9 col-xs-12 panel-col-seventy"><div class="row"><div class="col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12 panel-col-center"><div class="entry-box"><div class="entry-content"> <section><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="col-md-9 col-sm-12 col-xs-12"><div class="kopa-faq-section"><div class="faq-filter clearfix"><ul class="pull-left clearfix"><li class="current"><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/accommodation/Kuala-Lumpur?display=Kuala-Lumpur-Campus" class="current" >Kuala Lumpur Campus</a></li><li class="Sarawak Campus"><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/accommodation/sarawak?display=Sarawak-Campus" class="Sarawak Campus" >Sarawak Campus</a></li><li class="Bandar Springhill Campus"><a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/accommodation/springhill?display=Bandar-Springhill-Campus" class="Bandar Springhill Campus" >Bandar Springhill Campus</a></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div> </section><div class="panel-separator"></div><div class="row mb-30"><div class="col-md-12 mb-30 text-center"><h3> Accommodation</h4><h4>(Kuala Lumpur Campus)</h4></div><div class="col-md-6 col-sm-12"><p style="text-align: justify;">The Accommodation unit of Alumni & Support Services Department is under the care of Student Affairs & Alumni. As management, part of our role is to observe cleanliness and maintenance of the hostel, to establish security and safety in the residential halls, to ensure that integration between the residents is maintained, and that the rules and regulations of the hostel are adhered, to ensure students would enjoy their learning and living at UCSI University.</p></div><div class="col-md-6 col-sm-12 text-center"> <img alt="" src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsi_website_acommodation-01.png" /></div></div><div class="mb-30"><div class="col-sm-7 style-box1" style="background-color: #c9111d;"> <b style="padding-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 2px solid #fff;">Objectives</b> <br /> <br /><p><b>We are committed to provide students:</b></p><ul><li>a safe and secure, comfortable and clean living environment</li><li>the assurance that our residents have opportunities for personal development and growth</li><li>our understanding and a quick response to the needs of our resident-students collectively and individually</li><li>the independence of a self-catering accommodation or the more traditional feel of a catered residence</li></ul></div><div class="col-sm-5 style-box1" style="background-color: #9c0e1e;"> <b style="padding-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 2px solid #fff;">Services</b> <br /> <br /><p>It includes ensuring students enjoy the experience of living in an impressive quality environment. UCSI University offers students a healthy residence with services that support their learning and development process.</p><p>Students can opt to either reside in UCSI University's on-campus residential halls or at the off-campus condominium-styled accommodations. We also provide temporary accommodations for our students and guests who are coming for a short stay.</p></div></div><br /><div class="col-xs-12 mb-30 text-center" style="padding-right: 0; padding-left: 0"><div class="col-sm-6" style="text-align: center"><div style="margin: 10px auto"> <a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/accommodation/accommodation-rules-and-regulations"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsi_website_acommodation_link1.png" /> </a></div></div><div class="col-sm-6" style="text-align: center"><div style="margin: 10px auto"> <a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/accommodation/guests-and-temporary-accommodation"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsi_website_acommodation_link2.png" /> </a></div></div><div class="col-sm-6" style="text-align: center"><div style="margin: 10px auto"> <a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/accommodation/important-forms"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsi_website_acommodation_link3.png" /> </a></div></div><div class="col-sm-6" style="text-align: center"><div style="margin: 10px auto"> <a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/accommodation/accommodation-faq"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsi_website_acommodation_link4.png" /> </a></div></div><div class="col-sm-6" style="text-align: center"><div style="margin: 10px auto"> <a target="_blank" href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/accommodation-brochure.pdf"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsi_website_acommodation_link5.png" /> </a></div></div><div class="col-sm-6" style="text-align: center"><div style="margin: 10px auto"> <a target="_blank" href="https://apps.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/accommodation/index.html"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsi_website_acommodation_link7.png" /> </a></div></div></div><h3 class="text-center">Accommodation Choices</h3><p class="text-center">There are two options for UCSI University accommodations:</p><p class="text-center"><b>On-campus Accommodation</b> - (Residential Halls) and <b>UCSI Off-campus Accommodation</b> - (Angkasa Condo)</p><br /><div class="col-xs-12 mb-40 text-center" style="padding-right: 0; padding-left: 0"><hr style="margin: 0; border: 1px solid red;"> <b style="border: 2px solid red; color: #fe0100; padding: 8px 10px; position: relative; top: 5px; box-shadow: #fe0100 5px 6px;">On-campus Accommodation</b></div><div class="col-sm-6" style="padding: 0;"><p style="text-align: justify;">Our Residential Halls provide twin – sharing rooms at block E & D. Limited units of single room with en-suite bathroom are available at Block E. The Hall segregated into male & female quarters and equipped with a common visiting area for family and friends.</p><p style="text-align: justify;">The University offers a comprehensive on-campus accommodation service for students wishing to live on-campus.</p> <br /><div class="service-cat"><p><b>The Residential Halls provide the following services:</b></p> <br /><div class="col-xs-6 col-md-4 services-icon1"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsi_website_acommodation-03.png" alt="" /><br /><p>Air conditioning</p></div><div class="col-xs-6 col-md-4 services-icon1"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsi_website_acommodation-04.png" alt="" /><br /><p>Laundry service</p></div><div class="col-xs-6 col-md-4 services-icon1"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsi_website_acommodation-05.png" alt="" /><br /><p>In-house cafeteria</p></div><div class="col-xs-6 col-md-4 services-icon1"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsi_website_acommodation-06.png" alt="" /><br /><p>24-hours WiFi service</p></div><div class="col-xs-6 col-md-4 services-icon1"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsi_website_acommodation-08.png" alt="" /><br /><p>Hot water showers</p></div><div class="col-xs-6 col-md-4 services-icon1"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsi_website_acommodation-09.png" alt="" /><br /><p>Surau</p> <span>Prayer Room</span></div><div class="col-xs-6 col-md-4 services-icon1"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsi_website_acommodation-10.png" alt="" /><br /><p>24-hour security</p></div><div class="col-xs-6 col-md-4 services-icon1"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsi_website_acommodation-23.png" alt="" /><br /><p>Disability Friendly</p></div></div><hr><div class="service-cat"><p><b>Room furnishings include:</b></p> <br /><div class="col-xs-6 col-md-4 services-icon1"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsi_website_acommodation-13.png" alt="" /><br /><p>Bed frame + mattress</p></div><div class="col-xs-6 col-md-4 services-icon1"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsi_website_acommodation-12.png" alt="" /><br /><p>Study table + chair</p></div><div class="col-xs-6 col-md-4 services-icon1"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsi_website_acommodation-11.png" alt="" /><br /><p>Wardrobe</p></div><div class="col-xs-6 col-md-4 services-icon1"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsi_website_acommodation-15.png" alt="" /><br /><p>Power outlets</p></div><div class="col-xs-6 col-md-4 services-icon1"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsi_website_acommodation-14.png" alt="" /><br /><p>WiFi access</p></div></div><hr><div class="service-cat"><p><b>Pantry Items include:</b></p> <br /><div class="col-xs-6 col-md-4 services-icon1"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsi_website_acommodation-16.png" alt="" /><br /><p>Hot water dispenser</p></div><div class="col-xs-6 col-md-4 services-icon1"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsi_website_acommodation-17.png" alt="" /><br /><p>Microwave oven</p></div><div class="col-xs-6 col-md-4 services-icon1"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsi_website_acommodation-18.png" alt="" /><br /><p>Refrigerator</p></div></div></div><div class="col-sm-6" style="padding-right: 0;"><div class="accomm-pic"><div class="col-xs-12"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/block_d_hostel.jpg" alt="" /></div><div class="col-xs-2"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsi_website_acommodation-02.png" alt="" /></div><div class="col-xs-10"> <b>UCSI University</b> <br /> Block D</div></div><hr><div class="accomm-pic"><div class="col-xs-12"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/block-e.jpg" alt="" /></div><div class="col-xs-2"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsi_website_acommodation-02.png" alt="" /></div><div class="col-xs-10"> <b>UCSI University</b> <br /> Block E</div></div><hr><div class="accomm-pic"><div class="col-xs-12"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/block_e_hostel.jpg" alt="" /></div><div class="col-xs-2"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsi_website_acommodation-02.png" alt="" /></div><div class="col-xs-10"> <b>UCSI University</b> <br /> Block E</div></div></div><div class="row"><div class="col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12" style="padding: 0;"> <br /><br /><iframe width="560" height="315" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/mu-4spNq6Iw" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe><br /><br /></div></div><br /><br /><div class="col-xs-12 mb-40 text-center" style="margin-top: 30px; padding-right: 0; padding-left: 0"><hr style="margin: 0; border: 1px solid red;"> <b style="border: 2px solid red; color: #fe0100; padding: 8px 10px; position: relative; top: 5px; box-shadow: #fe0100 5px 6px;">Off-campus Accommodation</b></div><div class="col-sm-6" style="padding: 0;"><p style="text-align: justify;">Located in a condominium, Kuala Lumpur’s off-campus hostel are within the vicinity of the Campus. Each unit has a spacious living room, dining and kitchen area with common bathroom (master bedroom has an attached toilet and shower). It is also equipped with basic shared living amenities such as dining table, chairs, kitchen sink, washing machine, air-conditioners and WIFI.</p><p style="text-align: justify;">UCSI Off-Campus Accommodation (OCA) is exclusively managed and represented by UCSI Peterson Properties, part of the UCSI Group. Visit the <a href="https://www.ucsipeterson.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">UCSI Peterson website</a> for more details.</p> <br /><div class="service-cat"><p><b>Room furnishings include:</b></p> <br /><div class="col-xs-6 col-md-4 services-icon1"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsi_website_acommodation-13.png" alt="" /><br /><p>Bed frame + mattress</p></div><div class="col-xs-6 col-md-4 services-icon1"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsi_website_acommodation-12.png" alt="" /><br /><p>Study table + chair</p></div><div class="col-xs-6 col-md-4 services-icon1"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsi_website_acommodation-11.png" alt="" /><br /><p>Wardrobe</p></div><div class="col-xs-6 col-md-4 services-icon1"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsi_website_acommodation-03.png" alt="" /><br /><p>Air conditioning</p> <span>Optional</span></div><div class="col-xs-6 col-md-4 services-icon1"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsi_website_acommodation-15.png" alt="" /><br /><p>Power outlets</p></div><div class="col-xs-6 col-md-4 services-icon1"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsi_website_acommodation-19.png" alt="" /><br /><p>Fan</p></div></div><hr><div class="service-cat"><p><b>Unit furnishings include:</b></p> <br /><div class="col-xs-6 col-md-4 services-icon1"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsi_website_acommodation-18.png" alt="" /><br /><p>Refrigerator</p></div><div class="col-xs-6 col-md-4 services-icon1"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsi_website_acommodation-14.png" alt="" /><br /><p>WiFi</p></div><div class="col-xs-6 col-md-4 services-icon1"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsi_website_acommodation-04.png" alt="" /><br /><p>Washing machine</p></div><div class="col-xs-6 col-md-4 services-icon1"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsi_website_acommodation-20.png" alt="" /><br /><p>Dining table</p></div><div class="col-xs-6 col-md-4 services-icon1"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsi_website_acommodation-15.png" alt="" /><br /><p>Power outlets</p></div></div></div><div class="col-sm-6" style="padding-right: 0;"><div class="accomm-pic"><div class="col-xs-12"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsiresidence2.jpeg" alt="" /></div><div class="col-xs-2"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsi_website_acommodation-02.png" alt="" /></div><div class="col-xs-10"> <b>UCSI Residence 2</b> <br /> Taman Connaught</div></div><hr><div class="accomm-pic"><div class="col-xs-12"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/angkasa2.jpg" alt="" /></div><div class="col-xs-2"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsi_website_acommodation-02.png" alt="" /></div><div class="col-xs-10"> <b>Angkasa Condominium</b> <br /> Taman Connaught</div></div><hr><div class="accomm-pic"><div class="col-xs-12"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/lequadri_0.png" alt="" /></div><div class="col-xs-2"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/ucsi_website_acommodation-02.png" alt="" /></div><div class="col-xs-10"> <b>Le Quadri Kuala Lumpur</b> <br /> Taman Connaught</div></div></div><div class="col-xs-12 mb-40 accomm-contact" style="margin-top: 30px; padding-top: 20px; padding-right: 0; padding-left: 0; background-color: #9c0e1e;"><p style="color: #fff; padding: 0 20px">For more information concerning our accommodation facilities, please direct your enquiries to the Residential Hall at <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#44362c252828043127372d312a2d322136372d303d6a2120316a293d64"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="d8aab0b9b4b498adbbabb1adb6b1aebdaaabb1aca1f6bdbcadf6b5a1">[email&#160;protected]</span> </a> or you may contact us at:</p><div class="col-sm-6 style-box2"><hr style="border: 1px solid #d18390; margin-top: 0;" /> <b> ACCOMMODATION <br /> SERVICES UNIT KL CAMPUS: </b> <br /> <br /> <address> Student Affairs & Alumni Division<br /> 9th Floor, Block G, UCSI University Kuala Lumpur Campus <br /> No. 1, Jalan UCSI, UCSI Heights (Taman Connaught),<br /> 56000 Cheras, Kuala Lumpur,<br /> Malaysia </address><p><b>T</b> +603–9101 8880 <b>Ext</b> 2082</p></div><div class="col-sm-6 style-box2"><hr style="border: 1px solid #d18390; margin-top: 0;" /> <b> RESIDENTIAL HALL <br /> UCSI UNIVERSITY KL CAMPUS: </b> <br /> <br /> <address> Block D, UCSI University<br /><p><b>T</b> +603–9101 8880 <b>Ext</b> 3451</p> </address> <address> Block E, UCSI University<br /><p><b>T</b> +603–9101 8880 <b>Ext</b> 2000</p> </address></div><div class="col-sm-12 style-box2"><hr style="border: 1px solid #d18390; margin-top: 0;" /> <b>UCSI Off-Campus Accommodation Office</b> <br /> <span style="font-size:13px">(Managed by: UCSI Peterson Properties Sdn. Bhd.)</span> <br /> <br /> <address> 1st Floor, UCSI Group Showroom, Block A, No. 1, Jalan UCSI,<br /> UCSI Heights (Taman Connaught), 56000 Cheras, Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia </address><p><b>T</b> +603-9101 8880 Ext 3060/3061 <br /><b>E</b> <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#d5b0bba4a0bca7ac95a0b6a6bca5b0a1b0a7a6babbfbb6bab8"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="56333827233f242f162335253f26332233242539387835393b">[email&#160;protected]</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.ucsipeterson.com" target="_blank">www.ucsipeterson.com</a></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div> </section><div class="panel-panel panel-col-bottom"><div class="inside"><div class="panel-display panel-3col-33 clearfix" id="mini-panel-bottom_sidebar_v1"><div id="bottom-sidebar"><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="panel-panel panel-col-top"><div class="row"><div class="col-md-5 col-sm-12 col-xs-12"><div class="inside text-center"><div class="widget kopa-ads-widget-1"> <a href="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/awards-and-recognition"> <img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/logo-ucsi-footer_v14.png" alt="QS Ranking" /> </a></div></div></div><div class="col-md-3 col-sm-12 col-xs-12"><div class="inside text-center"><img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/logo-ir4.png" alt="Sustainable Development Goals"> &nbsp <a target="_blank" href="http://sdg.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/"><img src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/logo-sdg-2.png" alt="Sustainable Development Goals"></a></div></div><div class="col-md-4 col-sm-12 col-xs-12"><div class="inside"><div class="widget kopa-social-link-widget"><ul class="social-nav model-2 clearfix"><li><a href="http://www.facebook.com/ucsi.university" title="Facebook" class="facebook"><i class="fab fa-facebook"></i></a></li><li><a href="http://www.twitter.com/ucsiuniversity" title="X-Twitter" class="x-twitter"><i class="fab fa-x-twitter"></i></a></li><li><a href="https://www.instagram.com/ucsiuni/" title="Instagram" class="instagram"><i class="fab fa-instagram"></i></a></li><li><a href="http://www.youtube.com/ucsiuniversity" title="Youtube" class="youtube"><i class="fab fa-youtube"></i></a></li><li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/school/ucsi-education/" title="LinkedIn" class="linkedin"><i class="fab fa-linkedin"></i></a></li><li><a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@ucsiuni" title="Tiktok" class="tiktok"><i class="fab fa-tiktok"></i></a></li></ul></div></div></div></div><div class="row"><div class="col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12"><div class="inside"><hr></div></div></div></div><div class="panel-panel panel-col-bottom"><div class="row"><div class="col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12"><div class="inside"><div class="entity entity-bean bean-custom-content clearfix" about="/block/footer-links" typeof=""><div class="content"><div class="field field-name-field-custom-information field-type-text-with-summary field-label-hidden"><div class="field-items"><div class="field-item even"><div class="row"><div class="col-sm-12 col-md-3"><div class="widget widget_footer_menu hidden-xs-down"><h4 clas